      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "A study of 186 coronary patients with rhythm disturbance has shown that early incorporation of the elements of physical rehabilitation in combined treatment improves functioning of all the links of the blood circulation system, helps to raise cardiac rhythm stability and reduces the period of patients' stay in hospital."},
